- **Redaction/JSONL scanning**: `/Users/Sunny/2025prjs/entireio/cli/redact/showcase.go`
- **Summarization patterns**: `/Users/Sunny/2025prjs/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/summarize/summarize.go`

These patterns are actively used throughout the codebase and are battle-tested for handling real transcript data at scale.

